luie vergla\u00e7ante, surtout sur les r\u00e9gions \u00e0 l'int\u00e9rieur des terres en retrait des Grands Lacs ainsi qu'en terrain montagneux, o\u00f9 les temp\u00e9ratures pourraient \u00eatre pr\u00e8s du point de cong\u00e9lation ou juste en dessous de celui-ci.\n\nLes temp\u00e9ratures devraient monter au cours de la nuit, de sorte que la pluie vergla\u00e7ante se changera en pluie.\n\nVeuillez continuer \u00e0 surveiller les alertes et les pr\u00e9visions \u00e9mises par Environnement Canada. Pour signaler du temps violent, envoyez un courriel \u00e0 meteoON@ec.gc.ca ou publiez un message sur les r\u00e9seaux sociaux en utilisant #ONMeteo.","risk_colour_en":null,"risk_colour_fr":null,"confidence_en":null,"confidence_fr":null,"impact_en":null,"impact_fr":null,"feature_name_en":"Cornwall - Lancaster","feature_name_fr":"Cornwall - Lancaster","province":"ON","status_en":"ended","status_fr":"termin\u00e9","feature_id":"fea1-1208"}},{"id":"1506321101890631082202611250503_fea1-1192","type":"Feature","geometry":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[-77.29693116,44.25844137],[-77.34096456,44.3476188],[-77.54086919,44.2977736],[-77.53741962,44.29043099],[-77.54539389,44.28828529],[-77.56393439,44.2840318],[-77.56743411,44.29123191],[-77.65172088,44.26897443],[-77.72939844,44.43598656],[-77.74094966,44.43276705],[-77.74137691,44.43264498],[-77.74218565,44.43241992],[-77.75337834,44.42933011],[-77.7541871,44.42910886],[-77.76599796,44.42527898],[-77.76774201,44.42467176],[-77.78196708,44.41971726],[-77.7863008,44.41820666],[-77.79764636,44.41396848],[-77.80452084,44.41166053],[-77.80489471,44.41153464],[-77.81124273,44.41014222],[-77.81552307,44.40923048],[-77.81781966,44.40887187],[-77.8204901,44.40849801],[-77.82305373,44.40812797],[-77.82985191,44.40717424],[-77.84062502,44.40565975],[-77.868145,44.39981172],[-77.87671306,44.39783186],[-77.88470223,44.39598472],[-77.89177393,44.39434899],[-77.91293855,44.38962632],[-77.9132361,44.38956147],[-77.91376255,44.38944322],[-7